     C* Adjudication Message File (PMG01)
     C*
     C     MGKY1         KLIST
     C                   KFLD                    QQCO#
     C                   KFLD                    QQSUB#
     C                   KFLD                    QQFND
     C                   KFLD                    QQFYR
     C                   KFLD                    QQCASE
     C                   KFLD                    QQEOB#
